# ============================================================
#  .gitignore —— 信息隐藏技术实验报告 (LaTeX / XeLaTeX)
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. macOS 系统文件夹与文件
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.apdisk
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
__MACOSX/
*.icloud
Icon?

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. LaTeX 编译中间产物（源代码之外的临时文件）
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 辅助与日志
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.spl
*.brf
*.upa
*.upb
*.auxlock
*.loa
*.soc
*.xwm
*.thm
*.bibtoolrsc
*.pdfsync
*.comment.cut

# 目录 / 图表索引
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.mtc
*.mtc0
*.ptc

# 交叉引用 / 超链接
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.xdy

# 参考文献（BibTeX / Biber）
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.sbb

# 索引与术语表（makeindex / glossaries）
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.glo
*.gls
*.glg
*.ist
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.nlo
*.nls
*.nlg
*.glsdefs
*.lvr
*.lsr
*.maf

# latexmk / synctex / 其他引擎产物
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.xdv
*.dvi
*.lg

# 中间输出目录
latex.out/
auto/
.texpadtmp/
build/
out/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. LaTeX 编译结果（生成的 PDF）
#    只忽略根目录下的成品 PDF，子目录（如 imgs/ 中的图片 PDF）
#    仍会被正常跟踪，以免误伤作为素材的 PDF 图片。
# ------------------------------------------------------------
/*.pdf

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 编辑器 / 临时与备份文件
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.swp
*.swo
.#*
\#*\#
*.tmp
